# M1 keeps compact, reviewable source contracts and final evidence in Git.
# VCS executables/csrc trees, Design Compiler work databases, binary DDC, and
# raw run logs are reproducible from the versioned RTL, scripts, SDF, SDC, and
# curated text/JSON reports, so they remain local under this task-owned root.
synthesis/work/
synthesis/netlist/*.ddc
synthesis/run/
verification/**/run/

# M1-T promotes only its formal report-only STA evidence into version control.
# The root ignore policy still excludes ad-hoc DC reports from prior local
# experiments, so a reviewer receives the named, reproducible M1-T report set
# rather than an uncontrolled collection of tool transcripts.
!synthesis/reports/M1_T_*.rpt
